{"id": 7701867102406, "title": "1080P High - Performance Video Baby Monitor BM01", "body_html": "<ul>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"23,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"23,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Product Type</b></p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"23,0,1\">The BM01 is a classic, highly dependable <b data-path-to-node=\"23,0,1\" data-index-in-node=\"41\">momcozy monitor</b>. Operating as a secure and stress-free <b data-path-to-node=\"23,0,1\" data-index-in-node=\"96\">baby monitor no wifi</b>, it cuts through the technological clutter to give you instant, closed-loop peace of mind.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"23,1,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"23,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Core Selling Points</b></p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"23,1,1\">As an exceptional, practical <b data-path-to-node=\"23,1,1\" data-index-in-node=\"29\">non wifi baby monitor</b>, this unit utilizes a 2.4GHz FHSS wireless connection, meaning it forms a closed-loop system that no internet hacker can access. The 5-inch large display features a convenient split-screen function to take care of 2 babies or 2 different scenes simultaneously. The high-definition 1080P camera provides a movie-like viewing experience with a 360° field of view that automatically cycles between views to fully cover the baby's environment. Equipped with clear infrared <b data-path-to-node=\"23,1,1\" data-index-in-node=\"520\">night vision</b>, it allows you to observe your baby all night long in the dark. Backed by a powerful 5000mAh battery, it keeps guarding for up to 11.5 hours even with frequent checks.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"23,2,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"23,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Material &amp; Touch</b></p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"23,2,1\">Manufactured from RoHS-certified, lightweight, paint-free injection molded plastic that is entirely odor-free. Every edge is meticulously polished into smooth, rounded curves, ensuring a comfortable, feather-light grip.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"23,3,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"23,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Target Audience / Use Case</b></p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"23,3,1\">The ideal baby registry gift for expecting mothers and new parents who want an easy, app-free setup to watch over babies, pets, or the elderly with 100% privacy.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"23,4,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"23,4,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Size &amp; Compatibility</b></p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"23,4,1\">Features a compact, space-saving 5-inch display parent unit that fits easily on a nightstand or kitchen counter. The camera features full 360-degree panning capabilities.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"23,5,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"23,5,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Care Instructions</b></p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"23,5,1\">Avoid using the device in highly humid or dusty environments. Gently clean the charging port with a dry cotton swab if dust accumulates. Periodically cycle the battery to optimize its lifespan.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>", "vendor": "Momcozy", "product_type": "Baby Monitor", "created_at": "2022-11-04T04:58:41-04:00", "handle": "momcozy-video-baby-monitor", "updated_at": "2026-10-13T03:55:49-04:00", "published_at": "2022-11-07T03:59:43-05:00", "template_suffix": "bbm", "published_scope": "global", "tags": "baby care, baby monitor, baby safety, baby watch, best baby monitor, Breastfeeding supplies, Momcozy baby monitor, Top100_Sales, 婴幼儿", "variants": [{"id": 42585743622342, "product_id": 7701867102406, "title": "BM01 with 1 Camera", "price": "139.99", "sku": "BM005-WH10BA-B", "position": 1, "compare_at_price": "139.99", "fulfillment_service": "manual", "inventory_management": null, "option1": "BM01 with 1 Camera", "option2": null, "option3": null, "created_at": "2023-02-09T06:10:07-05:00", "updated_at": "2026-10-13T03:55:49-04:00", "taxable": true, "barcode": "333628276718", "grams": 0, "image_id": 36145489313990, "weight": 0.0, "weight_unit": "kg", "tax_code": "PI041075", "req